  #line-at(90pt, 185.52pt, "the Cu/dielectric interface due to the difference in acoustical impedance [30]. The ")
  #line-at(90pt, 216.72pt, "reflected pulses return to the surface and change the optical reflectivity, giving rise to ")
  #line-at(90pt, 247.92pt, "acoustic echoes in the TDTR in-phase signals. ")
  #line-at(90pt, 310.32pt, "In the bottom pad region (Fig. 2(a)), the echoes are attributed to the Al/bottom pad and ")
